# Per-user Xcode state. Kept out of git because the scheme files under
# xcuserdata/ hold the SUPABASE_URL / SUPABASE_ANON_KEY run environment variables
# (see README.md "First-run setup") — the same reason apps/mobile/.env is ignored.
# Shared, reviewable project state lives in project.pbxproj and
# project.xcworkspace/xcshareddata/ instead.
xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate
